  description="Month-by-month guide to Guilin Yangshuo weather, crowds, and scenery. The best months to visit are April-May and September-October. What to expect each season.">
  <h2>Quick Verdict</h2>
  <p><strong>April-May and September-October</strong> are the best months. Pleasant temperatures, minimal rain, and the landscape is at its most photogenic. <strong>Avoid the first week of October</strong> (Golden Week) — extreme crowds and prices.</p>

