      <div><span class="font-semibold">Aug</span> <span class="text-stone-400">Hot, humid. Budget-friendly period</span></div>
      <div><span class="font-semibold text-accent">Sep</span> <span class="text-accent">Excellent. Cooling, clear skies, great light</span></div>
